# core-vendor.manifest — provenance for files vendored from
# agenticapps-eu/agenticapps-workflow-core. Machine-read by
# test_migration_0014. Do NOT hand-edit: regenerate by re-vendoring.
#
# The vendored files are byte-identical to core and carry NO local header —
# a header would itself break the byte-identity it claimed to record.
#
# core_commit is a COMMIT, not a branch: a core checkout is a live
# workspace and may sit mid-change on a feature branch, and origin/main
# can advance BETWEEN two commands. Resolve it ONCE and vendor every file
# from that one revision — a per-file rev-parse is how the gate and the
# harness ended up from different commits on 2026-07-25.
core_repo=agenticapps-eu/agenticapps-workflow-core
core_commit=750da2e87a9a33b25addedea7b0d76a4346a81b9
